#. オメーら全員、
#. 黒幕と繋がってんだろ！？
msgctxt "0001 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"You guys have all been\n"
"working together, haven't you!?"
msgstr ""

#. 証拠もあるし、
#. 間違いねーべ！！
msgctxt "0002 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I have evidence,\n"
"so I know I'm right!"
msgstr ""

#. それは…
#. こっちのセリフだよ…！
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Hey!\n"
"You stole my line!"
msgstr ""

#. あんた達の方こそ、
#. 私を騙してるんでしょ！？
msgctxt "0004 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You're all out to get me,\n"
"I'm sure of it!"
msgstr ""

#. その証拠だって、
#. あるんだからね！
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I have evidence of my own!"
msgstr ""

#. 奇遇だな。
#. 証拠なら俺もあるぞ。
msgctxt "0006 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"What a coincidence.\n"
"I too have evidence to present."
msgstr ""

#. 俺以外の全員が
#. 組んでいる証拠がな…
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Evidence that proves everyone other\n"
"than me has been working together..."
msgstr ""

#. な、なんだ？
#. そりゃ…？
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Wh-What...?\n"
"Wait, hold on..."
msgstr ""

#. なんで、証拠を
#. 持ってんのが…
msgctxt "0009 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "This doesn't make any sense..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 9>３人もいる<CLT>んだって！？
msgctxt "0010 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"How can <CLT 9>the three of us<CLT> each\n"
"have that kind of evidence!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>知らないよ！<CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>I don't know!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>何…何の話なの…？<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>What are you talking about...?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>みんな落ち着いて…<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>Everyone just calm down...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>証拠はある…がどうだろうな。<CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>Does that evidence really exist?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>うぷぷぷぷぷ…<CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>Puhuhuhuhu...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>いきなり仲間割れ！！<CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>Time for an unexpected falling out!<CLT>"
msgstr ""
